      "description": {
        "fun": "A chunky baby dragon with a triangular fin on its back that soaks up heat and turns it into ice energy, so the hotter it gets, the more it stores. It uses that energy to keep its nest cool like a refrigerator, and picks a fight with Bergmite whenever they meet. Its look may borrow from Concavenator, a dinosaur whose back crest may have helped it control its temperature.",
