      "description": {
        "fun": "A towering ice dragon whose breath is cold enough to freeze lava. In battle it flips upside down onto its head and forelimbs and blasts its frigid breath to launch itself, sail first, at its foe. Its upright stance may nod to kaiju played by actors in suits, and it evolves at level 54, perhaps for 1954, the year Godzilla came out.",
        "guide": "The final evolution of Frigibax, a Dragon and Ice-type Pokémon that breathes air cold enough to freeze lava and attacks with its blade-like dorsal sail. Its name combines 'back' and Excalibur. It can Mega Evolve into Mega Baxcalibur in the Mega Dimension DLC for Pokémon Legends: Z-A.",
